build/icon-1024.png
# The offline conversion toolkit and the GB/T 9704—2012 typefaces it carries. Both are fetched or
# supplied per build machine: the binaries are hundreds of megabytes, and the 方正/中易 typefaces are
# commercially licensed, so committing them to a public repository would be redistribution.
# The directory itself stays tracked — electron-builder's extraResources needs it to exist.
build/tools/*
!build/tools/.gitkeep
build/fonts/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.coaligne/
.coaligneignore

